---
name: icones-lucide-only
enabled: true
event: file
action: warn
conditions:
  - field: file_path
    operator: regex_match
    pattern: \.(tsx|jsx)$
  - field: content
    operator: regex_match
    pattern: from ['"]@phosphor-icons/react|from ['"]react-icons/(?!si['"/])
---

ICON CANON VIOLATED: the project adopts ONE canonical icon library (`lucide-react`). The only extra package allowed: `react-icons/si` (Simple Icons brand logos).

Switch the import to `lucide-react` — look up the equivalent icon at https://lucide.dev. Mixing icon libraries breaks visual consistency (different weights/styles) and bloats the bundle. If THIS project's canonical library is a different one, edit this rule (`.claude/hookify.icones-lucide.local.md`) to reflect the decision — never live with two.
